WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:01.140
Hi guys!

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:27.340
Welcome to a new day! It’s Thursday.

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:30.080
We are in Málaga.

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:32.200
Today we’re going to talk in Spanish because

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:35.640
today I start my new Spanish course.

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:39.240
To understand all the people who live here you need to speak Spanish.

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:43.660
If you don’t do it, it isn’t easy to live here.

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:46.800
When I’m talking with people from Madrid

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:48.960
I understand majority from what they are saying.

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:54.840
They finish all the words and it’s easier.

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:57.000
But here (in Málaga) in Andalú (accent)...

00:06:57.460 --> 00:07:01.840
it’s a bit more difficult because it’s a different accent.

